        </div>
        <h3>Photography</h3>
        <p>
          Basic proficiency in Nikon & Sony cameras, capable of fundamental
          composition techniques.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="skill-card fade-in">
        <div class="skill-icon">
          <svg
            width="22"
            height="22"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
